<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-064" chapter-id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang" source-id="s-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang-ws1748895">
  <p id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0000" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA">龕</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0002" ref="g7w_9tv_iqb">僧辯</persName>婿也，始爲吳興太守，以陳武帝既非素貴，及爲之本郡，以法繩其宗門，無所縱舍。武帝銜之切齒。及<persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0049" ref="g7w_9tv_iqb">僧辯</persName>敗，<persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0053" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA">龕</persName>乃據吳興以拒之，頻敗陳文帝軍。<persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0069" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA">龕</persName>好飲酒，終日恒醉，勇而無略，部將<persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0086" ref="sdp_p72_67v">杜泰</persName>私通于文帝，説<persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0095" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA">龕</persName>降文帝，<persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0100" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA">龕</persName>然之。其妻<persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0106" ref="g7w_9tv_iqb_A">王氏</persName>曰：「<persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0111" ref="3eu_ixs_h1w">霸先</persName>讎隙如此，何可求和。」因出私財賞募，復大敗文帝軍。後<persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0139" ref="sdp_p72_67v">杜泰</persName>降文帝，<persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0145" ref="sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA">龕</persName>尚醉不覺，文帝遣人負出項王寺前斬之。<persName id="c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0164" ref="g7w_9tv_iqb_A">王氏</persName>因截發出家，杜氏一門覆矣。</p>
</text>
